                <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;What the colors mean&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E7D32&quot;&gt;🟢 &lt;b&gt;Green&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; — the normal route: h1 → s1 → s2 → h3&#xa;&lt;font color=&quot;#B85450&quot;&gt;🔴 &lt;b&gt;Red&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; — a broken link (the demo cuts s1–s2)&#xa;&lt;font color=&quot;#EF6C00&quot;&gt;🟠 &lt;b&gt;Orange&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; — the new detour after the break: h1 → s1 → s4 → s2 → h3&#xa;&lt;font color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;⚪ &lt;b&gt;Grey&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; — links that carry no traffic in the demo&#xa;&lt;br&gt;The controller simply picks the path with the fewest hops, so once s1–s2 is down it automatically goes the other way." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="140" width="880" x="40" y="500" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="facts" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Quick facts&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;&lt;br&gt;Clients: h1, h2&#xa;Backup servers: h3, h4&#xa;File is sent in 8 KB pieces&#xa;Switches are controlled remotely&#xa;Route = fewest hops&#xa;Recovery after a break: ~1.3 s" vertex="1">
